When I watched Scientifically Sweet make the white chocolate "brownies" as she calls them, I knew I wanted to make these in an ice cream. So let's make White Chocolate Blondie ice cream with a secret caramel sauce (Werther's Soft 😉)

Full recipe on Patreon and for YouTube members as normal. Yes, there is a lot to do for this ice cream make but it is SO worth it!

Use a high qaulity white chcocolate such as Valrhona, Guittards etc as it makes a hugh difference. 
I am also aware I didn't do the end page.....I was in a rush 😂😂

